---
---

<section class="contact" id="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-label mono-font">// 03</span>
      <h2 class="section-title pixel-font">contact</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-left">
        <p class="contact-intro">
          Tienes un proyecto en mente o quieres colaborar en un mod, tengo comisiones abiertas por si quieres traer una idea genial al juego que te vio nacer, Escríbeme.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/jhonatanlopezplay-art" class="contact-link" target="_blank">
            <div class="link-icon mono-font">GH</div>
            <div>
              <p class="link-label mono-font">GitHub</p>
              <p class="link-sub">Xplix</p>
            </div>
            <span class="link-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="https://modrinth.com/user/Xplix" class="contact-link" target="_blank">
            <div class="link-icon mono-font" style="color: var(--green);">MR</div>
            <div>
              <p class="link-label mono-font">Modrinth</p>
              <p class="link-sub">Mis mods publicados</p>
            </div>
            <span class="link-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="https://discord.gg/FN2nVRDP5e" class="contact-link" target="_blank">
            <div class="link-icon mono-font" style="color: #7289da;">DC</div>
            <div>
              <p class="link-label mono-font">Discord</p>
              <p class="link-sub">Servidor en donde trabajo</p>
            </div>
            <span class="link-arrow">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-right">
        <div class="terminal">
          <div class="terminal-header">
            <div class="terminal-dots">
              <span class="dot dot-red"></span>
              <span class="dot dot-yellow"></span>
              <span class="dot dot-green"></span>
            </div>
            <span class="terminal-title mono-font">xplix@portfolio:~$</span>
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-body mono-font">
            <p><span class="t-cmd">$</span> cat contact.json</p>
            <div class="t-output">
              <p>&#123;</p>
              <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;"alias": <span class="t-str">"Xplix"</span>,</p>
              <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;"role": <span class="t-str">"mod developer"</span>,</p>
              <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;"stack": [<span class="t-str">"Java"</span>, <span class="t-str">"Fabric"</span>],</p>
              <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;"open_to": <span class="t-str">"colabs &amp; fun projects"</span></p>
              <p>&#125;</p>
            </div>
            <p class="t-prompt"><span class="t-cmd">$</span> <span class="cursor-blink">▮</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <span class="footer-logo pixel-font"><span style="color: var(--cyan);">[</span>Xplix<span style="color: var(--cyan);">]</span></span>
    <p class="footer-text mono-font">
      built with <span style="color: var(--purple-light);">♥</span> &amp;
      <span style="color: var(--cyan);">Astro</span> · pixel art life
    </p>
    <p class="footer-year mono-font" style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.7rem;">2024</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .contact {
    padding: 6rem 0;
  }

  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--cyan);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 1.8rem);
    color: var(--text);
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .section-title::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -8px;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--purple), transparent);
  }

  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .contact-intro {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .hl {
    color: var(--purple-light);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .contact-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .contact-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
    transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
  }

  .contact-link:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-purple);
    background: var(--bg-card-hover);
    transform: translateX(4px);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .link-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-purple);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--purple-light);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .link-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .link-sub {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .link-arrow {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .contact-link:hover .link-arrow {
    color: var(--purple-light);
  }

  /* Terminal */
  .terminal {
    background: #050508;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-purple);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--purple-dim);
  }

  .terminal-header {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .terminal-dots {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
  }

  .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }
  .dot-yellow { background: #f59e0b; }
  .dot-green { background: #10b981; }

  .terminal-title {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .terminal-body {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 2;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .t-cmd {
    color: var(--green);
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
  }

  .t-output {
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }

  .t-str {
    color: var(--cyan);
  }

  .t-prompt {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .cursor-blink {
    color: var(--purple-light);
    animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
  }

  /* Footer */
  .footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 2rem 0;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .footer-logo {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--purple-light);
  }

  .footer-text {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .contact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
